e J K  Firm breast away from cavity Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number and  left axilla content  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm piece of fat containing multiple lymph nodes  The largest measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  The large lymph node is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as L M  The remaining lymph nodes are entirely as follows  one lymph node bisected as N  two bisected as O  and five as P  Resident  SOUHAD YOUNES  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  James Warren May Jr   M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B  LYMPH NODES  LEFT AXILLA  EXCISION   report_end  , Absent.
